        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad Golf is a casual but competitive multiplayer 2D golf game. Play local multiplayer or online with friends for lowest score or fastest time. Originally published for the Xbox Live Indie Games platform, it became an indie darling receiving international acclaim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actual internet comments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The game is the most fun with more than one player ... as players do not take &quot;turns&quot;, everyone just fires away until they make it at the same time.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Bad Golf on XBLIG is great and the cause of plenty of shouting at the TV at my place.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Bad Golf is actually pretty good.&quot;</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad Golf is a casual but competitive multiplayer 2D golf game. Play local multiplayer or online with friends for lowest score or fastest time. Originally published for the Xbox Live Indie Games platform, it became an indie darling receiving international acclaim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actual internet comments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The game is the most fun with more than one player ... as players do not take &quot;turns&quot;, everyone just fires away until they make it at the same time.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Bad Golf on XBLIG is great and the cause of plenty of shouting at the TV at my place.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Bad Golf is actually pretty good.&quot;</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Don't let the name fool you! A former Xbox Live Indie Games hidden gem, Bad Golf is a casual yet competitive multiplayer 2D golf game. Play a relaxing round by yourself or a frantic golf race with local or online friends.",
